          "description": "The Valentine Pebble is a heartwarming children's story about Penji, a young penguin on a journey to understand the many forms of love as he prepares for Valentine’s Day. Through his adventures with family and friends, he discovers that love comes in many shapes and can be shared in different ways. Perfect for children and families, this charming tale celebrates kindness, friendship, and the joy of showing others how much they mean to us.",
